# Circular Carousel — a paged horizontal FlatList of 9 round photos laid on an
# arc (translateY/opacity interpolated from the scroll offset); the SCALE switch
# springs every item's scale output range (withSpring on an array) so the
# centred photo grows and the sides shrink.
# What this test covers: page-by-page drags through all 9 items to the end and
# back, toggling Scale on mid-carousel (array spring while offset-driven
# interpolation runs), scrolling while the spring is in flight, fast flings to
# both ends (clamped extrapolation past the last item), toggling Scale off and
# on rapidly, and a final scroll with Scale off.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/circular-carousel"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "SCALE" 30000
wait "role=\"switch\" value=\"0\"" 8000
wait 1500
# Page through, one item at a time (LIST_ITEM_WIDTH ~100pt).
gesture pan 300 700 -110 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 300 700 -110 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 300 700 -110 0 500
wait 700
# Scale on: springs the output ranges.
press "role=\"switch\""
wait 200
wait "role=\"switch\" value=\"1\"" 8000
# Scroll while the scale spring is still in flight.
gesture pan 300 700 -110 0 400
wait 800
gesture pan 300 700 -110 0 500
wait 700
gesture pan 300 700 -110 0 500
wait 700
# Fling to the end and past it.
swipe 350 700 30 700
wait 600
swipe 350 700 30 700
wait 1200
# Back to the start in one fling, then a couple of single pages.
swipe 30 700 380 700
wait 600
swipe 30 700 380 700
wait 1200
gesture pan 300 700 -110 0 500
wait 700
# Rapid toggles: off/on/off/on with reversing springs.
press "role=\"switch\""
wait 150
press "role=\"switch\""
wait 150
press "role=\"switch\""
wait 1200
wait "role=\"switch\" value=\"0\"" 8000
gesture pan 300 700 -220 0 600
wait 900
gesture pan 100 700 220 0 600
wait 900
press "role=\"switch\""
wait 1200
wait "role=\"switch\" value=\"1\"" 8000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
